### Shutdown and Event Flushing Process

**Lines 67-82: onApplicationShutdown Method**

```typescript
async onApplicationShutdown(signal?: string | undefined): Promise<void> {
  if (this.client) {
    try {
      await this.client.flush();  // ← STAGE 1: Flush pending events
    } catch (e) {
      this.logger.warn(
        `Failed to flush LaunchDarkly events during shutdown: ${String(e)}`,
      );
    }
    try {
      await this.client.close();  // ← STAGE 2: Close client gracefully
    } catch (e) {
      this.logger.warn(
        `Failed to close LaunchDarkly client during shutdown: ${String(e)}`,
      );
    }
    this.client = null;             // ← STAGE 3: Clean up state
    this.isInitialized = false;
  }
}
```

### Two-Stage Shutdown Strategy

**Stage 1: Event Flushing (Lines 70-74)**

```typescript
