- **Boolean**: Pass/fail test results (true/false binary outcomes)
- **Numeric**: Quantitative measurements (temperature, alcohol content, etc.)

### 2. **SampleType Entity with Type Configuration** (sampleType/base/SampleType.ts:73-120)
