### 7. **Data Model Relationships**

```
SampleType (1)
  ├─ typeResultType: "Boolean" | "Numeric"
  ├─ typeNumericLowerLimit: null or number
  ├─ typeNumericUpperLimit: null or number
  ├─ typeUnits: optional string
  └─ typeDescription: optional string
      ↓
      (1:N)
      ↓
Sample (N)
  ├─ sampleTypeId: FK → SampleType.id
  ├─ sampleResult: boolean (for Boolean types)
