**Indexed tables:**

| Table | Purpose | Key Metadata |
|-------|---------|-------------|
| **Barrel** (lines 84-150) | Warehouse inventory items | Lot ID, location path, recipe, owner, status, disposition |
| **Lot** (lines 153-201) | Barrel groupings | Lot number, external ID, barrel count, confirmation status |
