**apps/whk-wms/src/providers/indexing/indexing.service.ts** (lines 622-650):

```typescript
private async cleanupDeletedRecords(
  namespace: string,
  sourceTable: string,
  existingIds: string[],
): Promise<number> {
  // Find vector documents with no corresponding source record
  const vectorDocs = await this.prisma.vectorDocument.findMany({
    where: {
      AND: [
        { metadata: { path: ["namespace"], equals: namespace } },
        { metadata: { path: ["sourceTable"], equals: sourceTable } },
        {
          NOT: {
            OR: existingIds.map((id) => ({
              metadata: { path: ["sourceId"], equals: id },
            })),
          },
        },
      ],
    },
    select: { id: true },
  });

  if (vectorDocs.length > 0) {
    const deleteResult = await this.prisma.vectorDocument.deleteMany({
      where: { id: { in: vectorDocs.map((doc) => doc.id) } },
    });
    return deleteResult.count;
  }
  return 0;
}
```

After indexing each table, removes vector documents whose source records no longer exist, preventing orphaned embeddings from polluting search results.

