### 3. Bulk Transfer Operation Flow

**apps/whk-wms/src/barrelOwnership/barrelOwnership.service.ts** (lines 784-880):

```typescript
async bulkTransferOwnership(
  operation: BulkTransferOwnershipInput,
  transferredBy: string,
): Promise<BulkOwnershipOperationResponse> {
  const operationId = createId();

  // Find matching barrels
  const barrels = await this.findBarrelsForBulkOwnership(operation.filter);

