---

### Data Model Distinction

**StorageLocation Model:**
- `apps/whk-wms/prisma/schema.prisma:33-49` (excerpt)

```prisma
model StorageLocation {
  id              String                   @id @default(cuid())
  createdAt       DateTime                 @default(now())
  updatedAt       DateTime                 @updatedAt
  warehouse       Int?                     // Warehouse number (01-10)
  floor           Int?                     // Floor within warehouse
  rick            EnumStorageLocationRick? // Rack identifier (A-Z, Hallway)
  position        Int?                     // Position on rack (1-21)
  tier            Int?                     // Tier/shelf level (1-30)
  locationPath    String?                  // Human-readable path "01-WHK01-01-1-030-A-1"
  globalId        String?      @unique
  typeField       Int?         @default(1)
  warehouseConfigId String?

  barrels         Barrel?      // One barrel per location (exclusive constraint)
  barrelAudits    BarrelAudit[]
