### Functional Differences

| Aspect | StorageLocation | HoldingLocation |
|---|---|---|
| **Purpose** | Structured warehouse racking system | Temporary staging/receiving areas |
| **Schema** | Hierarchical coordinates (warehouse, floor, tier, rick, position) | Simple name (e.g., "Receiving Bay 1") |
| **Capacity** | **1 barrel per location** (@unique constraint) | **Multiple barrels** per location |
| **Lookup** | Parsed from structured format "01-WHK01-01-1-030-A-1" | Simple string match on name |
| **Module Features** | CachedStorageLocationService for performance | Standard service (no caching) |
| **Use Case** | Long-term barrel storage in racks | Temporary holding during transfers/inspections |
| **Barrel Transition** | Barrels stay in same location for extended periods | Barrels pass through (transient) |
| **Example Locations** | "01-WHK01-01-1-030-A-1" (warehouse 1, floor 1, tier 30, rack A, position 1) | "Receiving", "QA Hold", "Staging Area" |

