## Missing Concurrency Patterns

| Pattern | Status | Impact |
|---------|--------|--------|
| **Optimistic Locking** (version field) | ❌ NOT implemented | Can't detect concurrent modifications |
| **Pessimistic Locking** (@transaction + row locks) | ❌ NOT implemented | Blocking reads/writes not possible |
| **Distributed Locking** (Redis redlock) | ❌ NOT implemented | No multi-instance coordination |
| **Idempotency Keys** | ❌ NOT implemented | Retry requests cause duplicate updates |
| **Conditional Updates** | ⚠️ PARTIAL - only markForRetry | bulkResolve has no conditions |
| **Status Machine** | ✅ PRESENT - defined states | But not enforced with constraints |

